  "brief": {
    "zh": "和三艘邮船争抢 18 块盖着邮戳的电池，抢完或 42 回合结束时要独占第一。第 7 和第 18 回合两座渡桥换班，未领取的船票邮戳会换到新码头。铜铃号追最近的邮票，另两艘船会随局势换目标。中央短廊在第 18 回合尝试关门，封在里面的电池可能留到终场。每块电池值一分。",
    "en": "Outscore three mailboats by collecting postmarked batteries. The race ends when all 18 are claimed or 42 turns are up. On turns 7 and 18 the ferry bridges change shifts and unclaimed ferry stamps move to new piers. Brass Bell heads for the nearest stamp while the other two boats adjust their targets. The central pocket tries to close on turn 18 and can trap its battery until the end. Each battery is worth one point."
  },
